    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροθ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shout in answer</i> or <i>in approval</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσις πάγκοινος ἅδ᾽</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιρροθεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					458
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορὸς . . ἰχθύων ἐπερρόθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					762
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				553
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Or.</u>
					901
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κτύπῳ</span><i>answer to,
				ring with</i> the sound, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				427
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>applaud</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοις ἐπιρροθεῖν τινα</span>
			<i>rage against, abuse</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				264
			</span></i>.</div>
